	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Keyword: ip

ip 1.1.1.1    look up an IP, a URL, or a hostname
ip            your public IP; if the clipboard holds an IP, Tab selects it

Return copies the row. Command-Return opens check-host. Option-Return opens ipinfo.io.

Sources: check-host (five databases), ip-api.com, ipapi.is, ipwho.is, ipinfo.io, and the RDAP registry. Rows stream in as each source answers. A clean result is cached for 6 hours.</string>
